      "regions": [
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "header",
          "text": "学习笔记 · 并发控制\n PostgreSQL 事务隔离与并发控制\n 从隔离级别到 MVCC 快照，从事务 ID 冻结到 WAL 与锁体系——这份笔记按机制顺序整理并发行为，并把生产风险放在左侧常驻速查。\n \n  隔离级别 MVCC 事务 ID WAL 锁体系 死锁 监控与实践",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "width": 375,
          "height": 330.515625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "nav",
          "text": "隔离级别 MVCC 事务 ID WAL 锁体系 死锁 监控与实践",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 254.328125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 54.1875,
          "fontSize": "13px",
          "lineHeight": "22.1px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "aside",
          "text": "风险速查\n  \n   LONG TX长事务阻塞 vacuum\n   XID事务 ID 回卷\n   WAL日志暴涨与归档失败\n   40P01死锁检测\n   40001序列化失败\n   IDLEidle in transaction\n  \n  \n   40001 序列化失败\n   REPEATABLE READ 下更新已被其他事务修改的行、SERIALIZAB",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 354.515625,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 434.265625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "r-serial",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "40001 序列化失败\n   REPEATABLE READ 下更新已被其他事务修改的行、SERIALIZABLE 下存在不可串行化的读写依赖时抛出。应用需捕获异常、回滚整个事务并重试。只读事务不受序列化冲突影响。",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 543.375,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 114.140625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "r-idle",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "idle in transaction\n   事务已开启但会话空闲，快照与锁持续持有，阻止 vacuum 清理旧元组。设置 idle_in_transaction_session_timeout 自动回收。",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 675.515625,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 95.265625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "main",
          "text": "01事务隔离级别\n   事务是一组要么全部提交、要么全部回滚的语句。用 BEGIN / START TRANSACTION 开启，COMMIT 保存，ROLLBACK 撤销。隔离级别定义并发事务之间的相互影响。\n   SQL 标准定义四个级别，PostgreSQL 可请求全部四个，内部只实现三种：READ UNCOMMITTED 在 PG 中与 READ C",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 796.78125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 6395.09375,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "isolation",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "01事务隔离级别\n   事务是一组要么全部提交、要么全部回滚的语句。用 BEGIN / START TRANSACTION 开启，COMMIT 保存，ROLLBACK 撤销。隔离级别定义并发事务之间的相互影响。\n   SQL 标准定义四个级别，PostgreSQL 可请求全部四个，内部只实现三种：READ UNCOMMITTED 在 PG 中与 READ C",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 812.78125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 1445.21875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "mvcc",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "02MVCC 多版本并发控制\n   多数 DBMS 用锁强制并发控制，PostgreSQL 以 MVCC 补充锁：同一数据行的多个版本可以共存，每个查询看到此前某个一致的数据快照。读写互不阻塞——读事务不会阻塞写事务，反之亦然。\n   每个元组头部保存两个事务 ID：\n   \n    xmin：创建该行版本的事务 ID；\n    xmax：删除或更新该行版本",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 2258,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 682.6875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "xid",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "03事务 ID 回卷与冻结\n   事务 ID 是 32 位无符号整数，最大值约 42 亿，之后循环复用，即 wraparound 回卷。为防止 ID 循环后数据不可见，VACUUM 执行 freeze，把很老元组的 xmin 标记为特殊 Frozen 事务 ID，永远对所有会话可见。\n   \n    autovacuum_freeze_max_age — 事",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 2940.6875,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 515.515625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "wal",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "04WAL 预写日志\n   修改数据页之前，先把变更写入 WAL（Write-Ahead Log），再刷磁盘数据页。流程：事务提交时变更写入 WAL 缓冲区；WAL 刷盘（fsync）后向客户端返回提交成功；脏数据页由 bgwriter / checkpoint 后续落盘。崩溃重启时回放 WAL 完成恢复，WAL 同时是物理流复制的数据源。\n   \n    ",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 3456.203125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 734.296875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "locks",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "05锁体系\n   表级锁共八种模式，名称含「ROW」的也是表级锁。两个事务不能在同一表上同时持有冲突的锁模式，但事务永不与自身冲突。非冲突模式可被多个事务同时持有。\n   \n    \n     \n      常用表级锁模式与典型 SQL\n     \n     \n      \n       锁模式\n       典型命令\n       冲突模式\n      \n",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 4190.5,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 1223.8125,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "deadlock",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "06死锁\n   两个或多个会话互相持有对方需要的锁，形成循环等待。PostgreSQL 后台死锁检测器自动检测，随机回滚其中一个事务并抛出 40P01 deadlock_detected。\n   根本原因通常是更新行顺序不一致。应用层保证更新资源顺序统一，可从根本上降低死锁概率。其他缓解手段：缩短事务、缩小锁范围、对热点对象设置 lock_timeout 或",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 5414.3125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 372.96875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "monitor",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "07监控与实践\n   \n    \n     pg_locks\n    \n    \n     锁详情，结合 pg_stat_activity 定位阻塞会话与锁模式。\n    \n    \n     pg_stat_activity\n    \n    \n     会话状态与等待事件；识别长事务与 idle in transaction。\n    \n    \n   ",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 5787.28125,
          "width": 335,
          "height": 1404.59375,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.2px",
          "fontFamily": "system-ui, -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        }
